WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.144
Page 4! You checked AI’s guess. Now be the maker!

2
00:00:06.344 --> 00:00:09.641
Playing and building with your hands is one of the best ways to learn.

3
00:00:09.961 --> 00:00:14.745
Leaf Rubbing! Make a hidden leaf pattern appear by rubbing a crayon over paper.

4
00:00:15.065 --> 00:00:21.148
You need: one fallen leaf, one sheet of paper, and one crayon with the wrapper peeled off.

5
00:00:21.468 --> 00:00:26.902
Step 1: Put the leaf under the paper. The bumpy side with the veins should face up.

6
00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:32.516
Step 2: Hold the paper still. Rub gently with the side of the crayon.

7
00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:38.130
Step 3: Keep rubbing. Watch the leaf’s outline and veins appear!

8
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.280
Whoa, it’s like magic!

9
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.892
Leaf Creature! Collect more fallen leaves. Then make a leaf creature!

10
00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:52.389
You need: fallen leaves, two sheets of paper, child-safe scissors, a glue stick, and crayons or markers.

11
00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:59.210
Step 1: Lay the paper flat. Arrange the leaves on the paper until you like your creature.

12
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:05.939
Step 2: Lift one leaf at a time. Rub glue on its back, then press it onto the paper.

13
00:01:06.259 --> 00:01:13.271
Step 3: Draw eyes, a beak, and legs on the second sheet. Cut them out, then glue them onto the leaves.

14
00:01:13.471 --> 00:01:18.208
Hoo-hoo! What creature will you make? Pause and make yours!
